
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome to CityCare</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 24px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f7fb;">
  <div style="max-width: 520px; margin: auto; padding: 32px; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px;">
    <h1 style="color: #1677ff;">Welcome to CityCare, <%= name %>!</h1>

    <p>Your email has been successfully verified, and your account is ready.</p>

    <p>You can now use CityCare to submit and track city complaints and service requests.</p>

    <a href="<%= portalUrl %>"
       style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 22px; background: #1677ff; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;">
      Open CityCare
    </a>

    <p style="margin-top: 28px; color: #777; font-size: 12px;">
      CityCare — City Complaint &amp; Service Request Platform
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
